WholesaleHub B2B (WBXX) tokenomics is designed to support a decentralized B2B wholesale marketplace with low-friction cross-border commerce, reputation-based trust, escrow protection, and decentralized product curation. The token serves dual functions: fee accrual (via 2.5% transaction fees redistributed to stakers) and access rights (enabling tiered governance participation and platform feature access). 

